{"speciesId":232,"names":{"fr":"Donphan","es":"Donphan","en":"Donphan","ja":"ドンファン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its TACKLE is strong enough to knock down a house."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Because this POKéMON's skin is so tough, a normal attack won't even leave a scratch on it."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"DONPHAN’s favorite attack is curling its body into a ball, then charging at its foe while rolling at high speed. Once it starts rolling, this POKéMON can’t stop very easily."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"If DONPHAN were to tackle with its hard body, even a house could be destroyed. Using its massive strength, the POKéMON helps clear rock and mud slides that block mountain trails."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A DONPHAN is so strong it can easily haul a dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a rock-hard state. An ordinary sort of attack won’t even leave a scratch."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take a long time to grow."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its TACKLE is strong enough to knock down a house."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its tackle is strong enough to knock down a house."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il attaque en se roulant en boule pour percuter l’ennemi. Il peut abattre une maison d’un seul coup."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il attaque en se roulant en boule pour percuter l’ennemi. Il peut abattre une maison d’un seul coup."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It attacks by curling up then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It attacks by curling up then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il a des défenses aiguisées et une peau épaisse. Ses charges peuvent détruire une maison."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene afilados y duros colmillos, y una gruesa piel. Su Placaje es tan fuerte que puede derribar una casa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its Tackle is strong enough to knock down a house."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鋭く 硬い キバと さらに 頑丈な 皮膚で 体当たりは 家をも 壊すほど。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Plus grandes sont ses défenses, plus haut est son rang dans le troupeau. Elles poussent lentement."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuanto más grandes son sus colmillos, mayor su estatus en la manada. Los colmillos tardan mucho en crecer."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"キバが 長くて 大きいほど 群れの中での ランクが 高い。 キバが 伸びるには 時間が かかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"L’attaque favorite de Donphan consiste à se mettre en boule et à charger son ennemi en roulant à pleine vitesse. Une fois qu’il commence à rouler, ce Pokémon a du mal à s’arrêter."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Donphan le encanta enrollarse como una pelota y cargar contra el enemigo rodando a toda velocidad. Una vez que ha comenzado a rodar, no es fácil pararlo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Donphan’s favorite attack is curling its body into a ball, then charging at its foe while rolling at high speed. Once it starts rolling, this Pokémon can’t stop very easily."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体を 丸めて 高速回転 しながら 相手に 突進する 攻撃が 得意。 転がり 始めると なかなか 止まれなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si Donphan décidait de charger, il pourrait détruire une maison. Grâce à sa force étonnante, ce Pokémon peut aider à déplacer les rochers et les coulées de boue qui bloquent les chemins de montagne."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si Donphan tuviera que dar un golpe con todo el cuerpo, con lo robusto que es echaría abajo hasta una casa. Estos Pokémon usan su fuerza para ayudar a despejar pasos de montaña cuando hay piedras o lodo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If Donphan were to tackle with its hard body, even a house could be destroyed. Using its massive strength, the Pokémon helps clear rock and mud slides that block mountain trails."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"硬い 体で ぶつかれば 家も 壊れる。 その 力を 使って 山道を ふさいだ 土砂崩れを どかす 仕事を 手伝うよ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":232,"moves":[{"name":"slam","learns":[[8,"level-up",24],[9,"level-up",24],[10,"level-up",24],[11,"level-up",24],[14,"level-up",24],[15,"level-up",24],[16,"level-up",24],[17,"level-up",24],[18,"level-up",24],[23,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"horn-attack","